# A singleton has its element as an upper and lower bound.
by def $is_real_upper_bound({2},2)
by def $is_real_lower_bound({2},2)
witness exist upper R st {$is_real_upper_bound({2},upper)} from 2
witness exist lower R st {$is_real_lower_bound({2},lower)} from 2
by def $is_real_bounded({2})
$is_real_bounded_above({2})
$is_real_bounded_below({2})
